WEBVTT

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.042
♪ When this moment come to us ♪

00:00:27.042 --> 00:00:29.417
♪ The Stars will always shine ♪
[Full-Time Magister 3]

00:00:29.812 --> 00:00:33.652
♪ The light travels through
the horizon to you ♪

00:00:33.709 --> 00:00:36.024
♪ Right now light it up
follow your heart, yeah ♪

00:00:45.801 --> 00:00:48.777
♪ Our dream of madness is rattling ♪

00:00:48.778 --> 00:00:50.773
♪ Just cause you feel it possible ♪

00:00:50.825 --> 00:00:55.319
♪ My eyes will open wide
in this cold, dark night ♪

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:58.536
♪ The heart bound by time
is just a shackle ♪

00:00:58.537 --> 00:01:00.687
♪ You said that dreams will never fall ♪

00:01:00.688 --> 00:01:03.946
♪ You put on the wings for me ♪

00:01:03.976 --> 00:01:08.108
♪ Braving through the wind ♪

00:01:09.643 --> 00:01:12.427
♪ When this moment comes to us ♪

00:01:12.439 --> 00:01:14.739
♪ My heart will no longer be lost ♪

00:01:15.316 --> 00:01:19.453
♪ I carry the weight of stars
and moon as I search for you ♪

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:21.879
♪ You summon me from the dream ♪

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:24.928
♪ My ambition is burning on ♪

00:01:24.929 --> 00:01:27.552
♪ You are the hope of light
in my darkest night ♪

00:01:27.553 --> 00:01:29.147
♪ On the other end of shine ♪

00:01:29.148 --> 00:01:31.666
♪ Let it all out and fight ♪

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:34.788
♪ Shine bright like it's
the end of the world ♪

00:01:34.866 --> 00:01:37.334
♪ The Stars is burning through the sky ♪

00:01:37.348 --> 00:01:39.218
♪ You hands are now ♪

00:01:39.219 --> 00:01:40.752
♪ Burning ♪

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:44.791
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:46.036 --> 00:01:49.839
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:50.798 --> 00:01:53.217
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:02:33.724 --> 00:02:34.884
What happened?

00:02:35.362 --> 00:02:36.375
Should we help him?

00:02:36.788 --> 00:02:38.757
We are in a test, we can't help him.

00:02:38.977 --> 00:02:42.700
Mo Fan, you are not
the master of this beast.

00:02:42.982 --> 00:02:46.516
You're using energy to bring it from
another dimension...

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:48.704
to yours for helping you in battle.

00:02:48.806 --> 00:02:50.380
You must not put it on leash by force.

00:02:56.291 --> 00:02:59.198
Turn the will into a rope?
But a rope means capture.

00:02:59.367 --> 00:03:00.100
That won't work.

00:03:19.375 --> 00:03:22.167
Once the emblem is on
the Summoning Beast,

00:03:22.211 --> 00:03:24.023
the summoning will be complete.

00:03:43.927 --> 00:03:46.981
So, you like it the soft way?
Your bad temper is just like mine.

00:04:06.036 --> 00:04:08.116
That is super Archwolf!

00:04:08.886 --> 00:04:11.884
How is it possible for him to summon
an Archwolf on his first attempt?

00:04:11.951 --> 00:04:14.825
That was indeed his first summoning.
I am very sure of that.

00:04:15.159 --> 00:04:17.892
His will is much stronger
than we expected.

00:04:17.971 --> 00:04:20.309
Chancellor Xiao, the Summoning
Faculty will accept this candidate.

00:04:20.625 --> 00:04:22.865
What is so great about
summoning an Archwolf?

00:04:23.242 --> 00:04:25.429
I can wipe out a group
of these pets myself!

00:04:25.936 --> 00:04:26.776
Wave Plane Shift!

00:04:28.562 --> 00:04:30.918
Allow me to have some fun with
your Archwolf here.

00:04:31.618 --> 00:04:34.035
Very well, the Archwolf
loves a good fight.

00:04:34.234 --> 00:04:36.983
It would be a shame to
simply summon it for a show.

00:04:37.339 --> 00:04:39.126
He is provoking you, fight him.

00:04:41.478 --> 00:04:44.314
This wolf is nothing
more than a watchdog.

00:04:44.696 --> 00:04:45.284
Bring it on!

00:04:47.135 --> 00:04:48.241
Sandstorm Volley!

00:04:55.903 --> 00:04:57.263
Wave Plane Collapse!

00:05:02.375 --> 00:05:03.594
Faster!

00:05:03.609 --> 00:05:04.374
Run!

00:05:16.105 --> 00:05:16.878
Damn it.

00:05:16.944 --> 00:05:20.898
I'll turn your first summoning beast
into a corpse!

00:05:21.209 --> 00:05:23.376
Lou Song is capable of using
Nebula spells?

00:05:24.375 --> 00:05:28.001
I've never expected he would show
his true strength so early.

00:05:28.042 --> 00:05:31.148
Not only is Young Master Luo Song
an Earth Talent mage,

00:05:31.199 --> 00:05:33.519
he is also a Starchart Mage
with Ice Talent.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:37.099
Let me show you
the true might of Ice Chains!

00:05:44.247 --> 00:05:47.087
You must be very unlucky to
face me in the battle.

00:05:49.579 --> 00:05:50.286
Stop!

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:56.840
There is no mercy in a battle.

00:05:56.900 --> 00:05:59.220
I need to teach this thing
a good lesson.

00:05:59.296 --> 00:06:00.133
No!

00:06:00.220 --> 00:06:01.849
Stop the fight, please.

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:03.537
Mr. Mo Fan, please calm down.

00:06:03.538 --> 00:06:04.346
Calm down.

00:06:04.457 --> 00:06:06.137
What is going on now?

00:06:06.792 --> 00:06:07.939
That purple glow is...

00:06:13.802 --> 00:06:16.344
A Nebula magic of Thunder Talent?

00:06:16.382 --> 00:06:19.156
Hurt my wolf and I will end your life!

00:06:19.196 --> 00:06:20.045
You fat man!

00:06:20.072 --> 00:06:22.793
This is just a test,
don't be so serious.

00:06:23.343 --> 00:06:25.740
Mr. Mo Fan, you could tell
us you're a Nebula mage,

00:06:25.918 --> 00:06:27.385
then we could have directly accepted you.

00:06:28.114 --> 00:06:31.035
An Nebula Ice Spell is no big deal.
You shouldn't force me!

00:06:31.112 --> 00:06:33.359
Young Master, please undo the spell.

00:06:40.819 --> 00:06:42.517
Wolf, come here.

00:06:45.391 --> 00:06:46.471
You did well.

00:06:46.605 --> 00:06:47.738
Mo Fan.

00:06:47.888 --> 00:06:51.235
We don't know why
a Thunder Talent mage like you...

00:06:51.304 --> 00:06:53.144
would choose to advance in
Summoning Talent magic,

00:06:53.511 --> 00:06:55.151
but your decision shall be respected.

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:56.584
From now on,

00:06:56.626 --> 00:06:59.418
you are a student of Summoning Faculty
in Mingzhu Academy.

00:06:59.583 --> 00:07:02.471
you, the fat one, you shall
be accepted into the Earth Faculty.

00:07:02.792 --> 00:07:04.959
You learned a good lesson
as soon as the semester started.

00:07:04.969 --> 00:07:07.273
-I...
-That is good for you.

00:07:08.691 --> 00:07:10.092
You are from Bow City?

00:07:12.162 --> 00:07:13.069
Not bad.

00:07:13.417 --> 00:07:16.876
I don't see a tint of scar left on you
by the tragedy that happened.

00:07:18.491 --> 00:07:20.509
Thank you,Chancellor.
Thank you, fellow teachers.

00:07:22.586 --> 00:07:24.147
You'll pay for this.

00:07:31.233 --> 00:07:33.666
Brother Mo Fan, I am accepted
into the Institute of Song City.

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:36.231
Great, congratulation, Xinxia.

00:07:36.536 --> 00:07:37.749
I will come by when I have the time.

00:07:38.118 --> 00:07:40.560
If anyone tries to bully you,
you must let me know.

00:07:41.829 --> 00:07:42.576
Xinxia.

00:07:42.642 --> 00:07:44.282
I will become an accomplished mage.

00:07:44.335 --> 00:07:46.478
I will get you the best
magical gears as wings.

00:08:00.067 --> 00:08:01.534
Okay, everyone is here.

00:08:01.944 --> 00:08:03.090
That's all?

00:08:03.463 --> 00:08:05.556
There are only seven of us
in the whole faculty?

00:08:05.804 --> 00:08:07.791
There is not even a girl here.

00:08:07.879 --> 00:08:10.120
Are we playing Calabash boys?
[A Chinese cartoon with 7 powerful boys]

00:08:10.806 --> 00:08:13.953
The Summoning Faculty is
the most unique of all.

00:08:14.126 --> 00:08:16.819
The way we teach is much different
from other faculties as well.

00:08:16.926 --> 00:08:19.340
We are basically letting you
do as you please.

00:08:19.623 --> 00:08:21.236
If you have nothing better to do,

00:08:21.263 --> 00:08:23.818
you may attend lectures of other
faculties as well.

00:08:24.321 --> 00:08:26.681
There is an welcome party tradition
in Mingzhu University.

00:08:26.962 --> 00:08:29.762
That is the most pressing matter
for the whole Summoning Faculty.

00:08:30.255 --> 00:08:31.597
The two best students...

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.603
will be rewarded with
a vial of Blood of Brute.

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:35.057
Well,

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.960
what is the blood for?

00:08:37.168 --> 00:08:40.209
The blood enables your Summoning beast
to undergo a metamorphosis.

00:08:40.404 --> 00:08:42.271
Its strength will be
increased tremendously.

00:08:43.863 --> 00:08:46.338
Mr. Jiang, tell us about
the welcome party.

00:08:46.338 --> 00:08:49.158
Hai Dafu.
You'll find out soon enough.

00:08:49.417 --> 00:08:52.542
It might even put all of you
under the school's spotlight.

00:08:52.785 --> 00:08:55.395
Or it could turn you into
the laughing stock.

00:09:07.444 --> 00:09:09.031
The laughing stock in the whole school?

00:09:09.209 --> 00:09:12.209
So they prepare the welcome party
specially for our faculty?

00:09:14.774 --> 00:09:16.614
I thought I was the first one to arrive.

00:09:17.606 --> 00:09:19.312
He is almost as handsome as me.

00:09:19.881 --> 00:09:20.788
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:09:21.258 --> 00:09:23.350
I am Zhao Manyan.
I major in Light Faculty.

00:09:24.114 --> 00:09:25.307
I am Mo Fan, I major in...

00:09:25.347 --> 00:09:27.235
I am Zhang Pinggu.

00:09:27.767 --> 00:09:29.340
Let's be friends from now on.

00:09:30.519 --> 00:09:31.719
Brother, that was smart.

00:09:31.746 --> 00:09:34.457
You can see through the
window from this angle...

00:09:34.488 --> 00:09:36.633
and the girl's dorm right
on the opposite.

00:09:37.312 --> 00:09:38.565
This is my bed.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:41.574
I didn't know it's you, Brother Zhao.

00:09:41.613 --> 00:09:43.380
It's okay, go ahead and take this bed.

00:09:44.633 --> 00:09:45.873
What do you major in?

00:09:46.799 --> 00:09:47.719
Summoning Talent.

00:09:48.724 --> 00:09:50.538
So, that senior was right.

00:09:50.787 --> 00:09:52.867
We are from
different faculty in our dorms.

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:55.918
Brother, I heard the Summoning
Faculty is in big trouble.

00:09:56.182 --> 00:09:57.871
Big trouble?
What do you mean?

00:09:58.067 --> 00:09:59.641
The welcome party.

00:10:00.001 --> 00:10:02.587
In previous years,
the Mingzhu University...

00:10:02.718 --> 00:10:04.500
would have a beast battle
in the welcome party.

00:10:04.701 --> 00:10:07.837
There would be a monster locked
inside a giant cage in the stadium.

00:10:08.154 --> 00:10:11.468
All new students are allowed
to go into the cage...

00:10:11.526 --> 00:10:13.166
and battle the monster.

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:16.684
It's a display of your own power
to the whole campus.

00:10:17.084 --> 00:10:18.835
Battle against the monster?
That sounds exciting.

00:10:19.101 --> 00:10:20.434
Who told you it's a monster?

00:10:20.763 --> 00:10:24.470
We will battle the beasts
the new students summon.

00:10:24.579 --> 00:10:25.836
What? It...

00:10:25.837 --> 00:10:27.585
It is as good as ripping us off.

00:10:28.903 --> 00:10:31.823
Well, the Summoning Faculty
is the most unique of us all.

00:10:31.876 --> 00:10:34.251
I envy you for getting the chance
of showing the whole campus...

00:10:34.278 --> 00:10:36.423
how strong your Summoning Beast is.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:38.597
You could catch a lot
of attention from the girls.

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:42.180
Mu Nujiao might even
fall in love with you.

00:10:42.883 --> 00:10:44.136
Fat chance.

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:45.368
Who is Mu Nujiao?

00:10:45.739 --> 00:10:46.805
Seriously?

00:10:46.918 --> 00:10:49.085
You don't know about the most
beautiful girl in school?

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:50.413
I don't have time for that.

00:10:50.649 --> 00:10:52.889
This battle against
Summoning Beast is brutal.

00:10:53.188 --> 00:10:55.065
You should pray for yourself.

00:10:57.721 --> 00:10:59.508
The competition in university is fierce.

00:11:00.042 --> 00:11:02.793
There are people that would use
the family resources...

00:11:02.847 --> 00:11:04.459
for some meagre personal gain.

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:07.552
The management remains
one eye closed on this.

00:11:07.736 --> 00:11:09.149
Watch your words and actions.

00:11:09.532 --> 00:11:12.565
Of course, if anyone crosses the line,

00:11:12.619 --> 00:11:15.360
feel free to let me know.
I will stand up for you.

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:18.416
I am asking for help from my teacher
because of some bullies?

00:11:18.617 --> 00:11:20.235
That would make me an useless brat.

00:11:49.577 --> 00:11:50.956
You are tickling me.

00:11:52.829 --> 00:11:53.935
You must be hungry.

00:11:57.083 --> 00:11:59.709
I have reach level three on
Summoning Stardust.

00:11:59.945 --> 00:12:01.905
This energy will help you
gain some strength.

00:12:19.847 --> 00:12:20.647
Brother Mo fan.

00:12:20.977 --> 00:12:23.255
See, the Summoning Beast Battle
is rather extravagant.

00:12:23.998 --> 00:12:24.838
But...

00:12:24.975 --> 00:12:27.541
the seven of you will face off
the whole school.

00:12:27.646 --> 00:12:28.393
That sounds harsh.

00:12:28.845 --> 00:12:31.658
I heard the other six are living
together in the same dorm room.

00:12:32.021 --> 00:12:33.848
They started training long ago.

00:12:34.126 --> 00:12:35.179
Yet they didn't invite you.

00:12:35.826 --> 00:12:36.639
Is that so?

00:12:36.959 --> 00:12:38.492
You seem quite mysterious.

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:40.957
Seeing that we live in the same dorm,

00:12:41.009 --> 00:12:42.542
tell me something about
your Summoning Beast.

00:12:42.836 --> 00:12:44.498
-It's an Archwolf.
-An Archwolf.

00:12:44.873 --> 00:12:48.162
It's far more powerful than
the average monsters out there.

00:12:48.683 --> 00:12:51.323
I bet you will put up quite a show
on the beast battle.

00:12:51.587 --> 00:12:53.480
Be careful, you will become
everyone's target.

00:12:53.849 --> 00:12:55.088
I will be your friend for sure.

00:12:55.141 --> 00:12:56.775
Feel free to ask me
if you need any help.

00:12:56.829 --> 00:12:59.345
You're a Stardust mage as well.
What could you help me with?

00:12:59.545 --> 00:13:00.777
You will find out soon enough.

00:13:01.948 --> 00:13:02.551
What is going on?

00:13:04.338 --> 00:13:05.205
This is bad.

00:13:09.289 --> 00:13:11.835
That wolf must have picked a fight
with other Summoning Beast again.

00:13:31.614 --> 00:13:32.600
Archwolf!

00:13:36.884 --> 00:13:38.973
I have never seen such a fighting lover like you.

00:13:41.844 --> 00:13:42.964
Don't die!

00:13:52.237 --> 00:13:53.264
I am glad you made it.

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:55.669
Well, I doubt I could get
the Blood of Brute now.

00:13:55.709 --> 00:13:58.627
You can't join the battle in this state.

00:14:00.572 --> 00:14:03.332
Did you find out anything about
their Summoning Beasts?

00:14:03.413 --> 00:14:05.016
I got most of the information.

00:14:05.167 --> 00:14:08.292
Hai Dafu will use
a White Armoured Wings,

00:14:08.351 --> 00:14:10.638
whose strength is on par
with an adult monster.

00:14:11.436 --> 00:14:13.089
Zheng Bingxiao will
use a Stone Golem,

00:14:13.103 --> 00:14:15.572
whose sheer power and defense
are very strong.

00:14:16.229 --> 00:14:18.271
Right, there is also
a Bone-eating Ghoul.

00:14:18.484 --> 00:14:19.898
Bone-eating Ghoul?

00:14:20.157 --> 00:14:21.744
That is not something
to be messing with.

00:14:21.955 --> 00:14:23.422
There is a guy named Mo Fan with them.

00:14:23.489 --> 00:14:25.933
I still couldn't find out
what his Summoning Beast is.

00:14:26.006 --> 00:14:28.376
We'll just pick on the easy one.

00:14:28.469 --> 00:14:31.445
We will get the reward as long as
we defeat one of them.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:39.896
Yang Yi, where are you?

00:14:41.346 --> 00:14:43.903
-I feel so nervous.
-What's the big deal?

00:14:44.338 --> 00:14:46.151
I love such an event.

00:14:46.767 --> 00:14:48.735
That guy is still not prepared yet.

00:14:49.135 --> 00:14:51.043
Is he planning to desert the battle?

00:14:53.595 --> 00:14:55.555
Before I start my speech,

00:14:55.889 --> 00:14:58.170
I must confirm one matter
with all of you.

00:14:58.566 --> 00:15:01.940
If you only plan on having
a job with high salary,

00:15:02.020 --> 00:15:03.819
and to have a high quality life,

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:08.172
I can surely tell you that
you are in the wrong place.

00:15:08.553 --> 00:15:11.220
The mages that graduate
from Mingzhu University...

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:14.096
have the power to change the world
for the better.

00:15:14.149 --> 00:15:18.410
They will be heroes that
protect the humankind.

00:15:19.077 --> 00:15:21.743
We are not short of money and fame.

00:15:21.918 --> 00:15:25.794
What we need is a heart that
pursue the highest level of magic.

00:15:26.667 --> 00:15:30.168
Today is your chance to show
the world what you are capable of.

00:15:30.703 --> 00:15:35.369
Let's welcome the seven new students
from the Summoning Faculty.

00:15:35.871 --> 00:15:37.565
-Mo Fan?
-What's wrong?

00:15:37.933 --> 00:15:39.529
No, it's nothing.

00:15:39.965 --> 00:15:42.794
-I just saw an old friend of mine.
-Don't be nervous.

00:15:42.874 --> 00:15:44.930
The Summoning Faculty may be special,

00:15:45.023 --> 00:15:47.595
but that doesn't mean
they are stronger than us.

00:15:47.815 --> 00:15:50.349
The Thunder Faculty
is never afraid of anyone.

00:15:52.019 --> 00:15:54.533
He didn't know about Summoning
Talent when we first met.

00:15:54.664 --> 00:15:56.674
You mean he has Double Talents?

00:15:57.176 --> 00:15:59.323
Many might disagree...

00:15:59.456 --> 00:16:02.744
why the Summoning Faculty
gets focus as the semester begins.

00:16:03.006 --> 00:16:05.374
It's all right, just defeat them.

00:16:05.414 --> 00:16:07.826
Then, you will become
the true hero of the day!

00:16:10.378 --> 00:16:12.004
Who shall start first?

00:16:12.744 --> 00:16:13.610
I'll go!

00:16:14.556 --> 00:16:16.622
I leave this to you.

00:16:16.782 --> 00:16:19.049
-Watch your back, Hai Dafu!
-Go for it, Hai Dafu!

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.817
All of you can come at me together!

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:30.108
I don't want to waste my time.

00:16:30.175 --> 00:16:33.493
Brat, I can crush your Summoning
Beast in one swift move!

00:16:33.494 --> 00:16:34.467
-Come on!
-Get him!

00:16:35.164 --> 00:16:36.294
That's all you've got?

00:16:36.417 --> 00:16:38.691
You are no match for
my Summoning Beast.

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:00.510
Come on!

00:17:05.574 --> 00:17:09.378
♪ Until we start to fight keep alive ♪

00:17:09.379 --> 00:17:12.606
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

00:17:12.632 --> 00:17:15.610
♪ You will breaking through the night ♪

00:17:15.623 --> 00:17:18.200
♪ Fire in your eyes shining so bright ♪

00:17:22.873 --> 00:17:25.128
♪ Every lonely journey I begin ♪

00:17:25.129 --> 00:17:27.189
♪ Is another mystery
this life gives me ♪

00:17:27.228 --> 00:17:29.343
♪ I can't escape my fate, but why? ♪

00:17:29.378 --> 00:17:32.611
♪ Who tipped the balance
of this season? ♪

00:17:33.101 --> 00:17:36.284
♪ Is the crushing blow necessary ♪

00:17:36.285 --> 00:17:37.879
♪ For one to rise up and see? ♪

00:17:37.906 --> 00:17:40.546
♪ Fight on in this uphill battle ♪

00:17:40.547 --> 00:17:42.824
♪ Face the reality ♪

00:17:42.845 --> 00:17:45.538
♪ Setting foot in this forbidden city ♪

00:17:45.565 --> 00:17:48.870
♪ Breaking the rules that silence me ♪

00:17:49.608 --> 00:17:50.919
♪ The more I go against it ♪

00:17:50.963 --> 00:17:52.352
♪ The more certain I am ♪

00:17:52.353 --> 00:17:54.467
♪ As I follow my heart ♪

00:17:55.191 --> 00:17:56.361
♪ The wind blows ♪

00:17:56.362 --> 00:17:58.637
♪ I am soaring into the sky ♪

00:17:58.638 --> 00:17:59.570
♪ As we meet ♪

00:17:59.571 --> 00:18:01.676
♪ One time you fight the fear ♪

00:18:01.677 --> 00:18:03.177
♪ Fly to high ♪

00:18:03.213 --> 00:18:06.676
♪ Every drop of sweat remembers
how you have tried ♪

00:18:06.719 --> 00:18:08.470
♪ You are born to be the one ♪

00:18:08.471 --> 00:18:10.391
♪ Who realize all desires ♪

00:18:10.392 --> 00:18:12.572
♪ Until we start to fight ♪

00:18:12.593 --> 00:18:13.897
♪ Keep alive ♪

00:18:13.898 --> 00:18:17.245
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

00:18:17.246 --> 00:18:20.175
♪ You will breaking through the night ♪

00:18:20.176 --> 00:18:23.642
♪ Fire in your eyes shining so bright ♪

00:18:24.178 --> 00:18:25.277
♪ Oh ♪

00:18:25.904 --> 00:18:29.546
♪ You're always standing by my side ♪
